{"name": "We Need An Army", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tactical roguelite autobattler. Collect units, discover relics, and play mini games to create the ultimate army.  Can you shuffle your way to victory in this chaotic roguelike army builder?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect and upgrade units and relics</strong> to crush your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle with your grid\u00a0</strong>- Shuffle your board, line up bonuses, and lock in patterns to unleash your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a new map</strong>\u00a0<strong>each time</strong> - discover random events, mini games, and fight with no two runs being the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"325\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/0f16f47d63985bd7c0dcaf343abb4d2e.avif?t=1789832476\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Align the grid to find the best bonuses, then unleash your army on your enemies!\u00a0 Focus on matching class patterns, bonus tiles, or whatever you need on a given turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/11407510cb3581e91e18610edf6e81a6.poster.avif?t=1789832476\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/11407510cb3581e91e18610edf6e81a6.webm?t=1789832476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/11407510cb3581e91e18610edf6e81a6.mp4?t=1789832476\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"325\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/52b48c87ecf4b7e40d5cfc822dadce45.avif?t=1789832476\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With dozens of unlockable commanders and units, find the right offense (or defense) that's right for you! Mix attackers, defenders, merchants, and healers to create awesome strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/be676765139f3e0ed6040a0fe2b60191.poster.avif?t=1789832476\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/be676765139f3e0ed6040a0fe2b60191.webm?t=1789832476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/be676765139f3e0ed6040a0fe2b60191.mp4?t=1789832476\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"325\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/ae6054663b6b8691b99d25acad55f1b5.avif?t=1789832476\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play minigames to boost your damage, recruit more units, and find powerful relics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" post